  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4SustainableCentralAsia: Renewable Energy in Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/strong&gt; of the Action is to improve regional cooperation and governance for sustainable development in Central Asia.&lt;s&gt; &lt;/s&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective&lt;/strong&gt; (outcome) of the Action is to strengthen framework conditions for regional and national integration of renewable energy (RE) in Central Asia (CA).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The areas of support (outputs) are: (1) Planning, monitoring and operation of national and regional electricity grids; (2) National institutional investment frameworks for renewable energy and energy efficiency; (3) Regional academic learning in the field of energy system analysis, (4) Planning and implementation of national gender-sensitive information campaigns in RE, EE and digitalisation in the power sector and (5) Political cross-border dialogue on electricity network cooperation with focus on integration of RE.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
